### END — Resources & closing (extension)
- Kicker: If you only read one thing
- Title: "Stitching doesn't require consistency. *It requires connection.*"
- Lead: Nathan Curtis, Stitching Prototypes (EightShapes, 2015). The Marriott International case study is the clearest illustration of the concept. Assign as pre-reading if teaching this as a standalone session.
- Sign: Winnie Nguyen
